readnews - read topics

usage: readnews [-n|-l|-c] [group]

    Not notes. Shows unread items of subscribed streams in order.
    The default group is local. topic is the same.

    -n          nonstop (headline and body in a row)
    -l          list unread headlines only (do not read)
    -c          just whether there is unread (News. / No news.)

    The three venues (notes/mail/news / chat/talk) share the same keys.
      i  show the list (headlines of the current group)
      q  quit (save read position; x does not save)
      ?  help (-? also works)

    empty Enter  body, or next
    n / + / ;    next (skip the body)
    N [group]    next group; with a name, go to that group
    U            unsubscribe the current group (go to next group)
    r            mail the author (subject is Re: ...)
    x            quit; leave the read position untouched
    f            follow-up (only for those who may post)

    Unsubscription lasts until you clear the cursor by hand. Naming
    (N group / readnews group) lets you read even while unsubscribed.
    Post with postnews (sysop / co-sysop).
